    "title": "Ice Princess Makeup Salon",
    "description": "Find the perfect match for three beautiful ice princesses that are looking for a refreshing change in their look. Play this makeover game and create some pretty looks for all the clients from your salon. In the game, you will find multiple beauty challenges that are ready to be completed and you are about to find out how to finish them all. You have the opportunity to pick the princess you want to start this fashion adventure and then you will navigate through each step. Begin your quest with the spa session where you will take care of the basic needs of the princess. Wash her hair and make sure you follow her skincare routine in order to obtain a clean and bright skin tone. Apply the special products and let her know she is going to be pampered in this step. When this part is completed you will move into the makeover phase. Here you get to choose her hairstyle, the color of her eyes and you could use some makeup tricks to improve her look. The next step comes with great responsibility because in here you will find the most suitable outfit for your girl. Put on matching accessories and don't forget to add some awesome shoes with that glamorous dress you've found. All that's left is to arrange the background for your photo shooting and your first princess will be ready to pose. Create a winter wonderland picture and frame your first sister in it. You can even save your progress, also you could press replay to try out new looks with the rest of the sisters. Have a great time and find as many fashion combinations as you can.\r\n\r\nThis game brings a lot of joy besides the cool features:\r\n- Easy and free to play\r\n- Ice princess sisters to help with a makeover\r\n- Makeup and dress-up activities \r\n- Wonderful soundtrack\r\n- Manage a salon for royalties\r\n- Fashion challenges and pampering in the spa section\r\n- Pretty outfits to create with lots of accessories\r\n- Lovely characters and storyline",
